1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,100
How much do you spend on looking after yourself each month?
你每月会花多少钱打理自己？

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:11,710
We all like to look and feel good, so it's nice to spend money on ourselves sometimes!
我们都想外表光鲜、状态舒适，所以偶尔为自己花钱是件很美好的事！

3
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:19,820
You might spend your hard-earned cash on visiting the hairdresser, a gym membership or pampering yourself with a massage.
你可能会把辛苦赚来的钱花在去理发店、办健身会员，或是享受按摩放松上。

4
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:31,250
When it comes to hair and beauty, the average UK household spends just under 2% of their budget, according to personal finance experts, Nimble Fins.
个人理财专家Nimble Fins的数据显示，在美发美容方面，英国家庭平均花费占预算的近2%。

5
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:37,820
That's about £38 a month if you have an annual salary of £30,000.
如果年薪3万英镑，每月大约花费38英镑。

6
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:48,090
Areas that were looked at in their survey included toiletries, cosmetics, and related electrical appliances, like hairdryers.
他们的调查涵盖了洗护用品、化妆品以及吹风机等相关电器。

7
00:00:48,090 --> 00:00:53,330
However, it seems that some people spend much more than that.
然而，有些人的花费远高于这个数字。

8
00:00:53,330 --> 00:01:12,540
The booking app for all things aesthetic, Pamperbook, carried out a survey in 2022 of 900 UK salons and freelancers. The results found that female clients who use the app spend, on average, £1,000 per month.
美容预约应用Pamperbook在2022年对英国900家美容院和自由从业者展开调查，结果显示，使用该应用的女性客户月均消费1000英镑。

9
00:01:12,540 --> 00:01:21,710
The survey showed that the most popular treatments were lashes and lip fillers, while customers frequently visited hair salons for a blow dry.
调查显示，最受欢迎的项目是美睫和丰唇填充，顾客也常去理发店做吹风造型。

10
00:01:21,710 --> 00:01:25,850
But it's not only women who spend money on beauty.
并非只有女性会在美容上花钱。

11
00:01:25,850 --> 00:01:38,130
Though men and women visit spas more or less equally, according to the International Spa Association, or ISPA, men spend more on treatments.
国际水疗协会（ISPA）的数据显示，尽管男性与女性光顾水疗中心的频次大致相当，但男性在护理项目上的花费更高。

12
00:01:38,130 --> 00:01:51,780
A national survey in 2019 found that male participants spend more on massages and facials per year than women – £501 to £445.
2019年的一项全国调查发现，男性受访者每年在按摩和面部护理上的花费高于女性——分别为501英镑和445英镑。

13
00:01:51,780 --> 00:02:06,420
Garrett Mersberger, head of the ISPA, said: "Men are more aware that it's not just a thing I go to to get pampered. It's an actual lifestyle choice with benefits to my body, my wellness."
国际水疗协会负责人加勒特·梅斯伯格表示：“男性越发意识到，这不仅仅是去享受放松，实际上更是一种对身心有益的生活方式的选择。”

14
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:15,060
Whether you tend to spend money on these things or not, it can certainly feel good to treat yourself every now and then!
无论你是否习惯在这些方面花钱，偶尔犒劳自己的感觉真的很棒！
